
## Build

### build bin/lab

```
$ go build -o bin/lab ./cmd/lab
(exit 0)
```

### cross-build resticlab linux/arm64

```
$ go build -trimpath -o /var/folders/fv/g68cb08n70qg4kf8hl3tzl0c0000gn/T//dbcm-e11.18Ix3M/resticlab ./cmd/resticlab
(exit 0)
```

### cross-build manager E11 test binary

```
$ go test -c -o /var/folders/fv/g68cb08n70qg4kf8hl3tzl0c0000gn/T//dbcm-e11.18Ix3M/manager.test ./internal/manager
(exit 0)
```

