## Install restic (0.19.1) with checksum verification

### packages on dbcm-lab-m1

```
$ vm_sh dbcm-lab-m1 sudo apt-get update -qq >/dev/null 2>&1; sudo DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get install -y -qq bzip2 openssl curl ca-certificates openssh-client openssh-server >/dev/null 2>&1; which bunzip2 openssl curl ssh sshd
/usr/bin/bunzip2
/usr/bin/openssl
/usr/bin/curl
/usr/bin/ssh
/usr/sbin/sshd
(exit 0)
```

### download restic on dbcm-lab-m1

```
$ vm_sh dbcm-lab-m1 cd /tmp && curl -fsSL -o restic.bz2 https://github.com/restic/restic/releases/download/v0.19.1/restic_0.19.1_linux_arm64.bz2 && ls -l restic.bz2
-rw-r--r-- 1 <user> <user> 9044264 Oct 27 12:37 restic.bz2
(exit 0)
```

restic.bz2: FAILED
